~ cutscene
set voice_pitch = 0.5
Tricericop: The city is saved! The statue is fixed and the mayor's in jail.
Tricericop: Ain't she a beauty?
Tricericop: I guess now you can go back home. Say, where'd you say you're from again?
Toby: *[wave]Roar[/wave]*
Tricericop: Haha! You're such a crack-up. 
Tricericop: You know, legend has it this shrine has the power to bend time and space.
Tricericop: If you knew how to activate it, you could even use it to skip your commute home!
Tricericop: What a dream that'd be, huh?
set seen_museum_outro = true
=> END

~ start
set voice_pitch = 0.5
if shrine_activated
	Tricericop: Good heavens! What in God's name is that?
	Tricericop: Stay back donut boy! It's not safe!
else
	Tricericop: I think I remember hearing something about needing three offerings...
	Tricericop: Heh. I could use three offerings right about now if you know what I mean...
	Tricericop: AND IF YOU DON'T KNOW WHAT I MEAN, I'M HUNGRY!
	Tricericop: *[wave]Gratuitous laughter[/wave]*
=> END